<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-songshu" book-id="b-songshu-050" chapter-id="c-songshu-050-yuan-lang" source-id="s-songshu-050-yuan-lang-ws2371899">
  <p id="c-songshu-050-yuan-lang:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-songshu-050-yuan-lang:p001:m0000" ref="av0_ly9_952">遵</persName>子<persName id="c-songshu-050-yuan-lang:p001:m0002" ref="av0_ly9_952_A">閬</persName>，元嘉中，為員外散騎侍郎。母墓為東阿寺道人<persName id="c-songshu-050-yuan-lang:p001:m0024" ref="r8r_y2a_mif">曇洛</persName>等所發，<persName id="c-songshu-050-yuan-lang:p001:m0030" ref="av0_ly9_952_A">閬</persName>與弟殿中將軍<persName id="c-songshu-050-yuan-lang:p001:m0037" ref="av0_ly9_952_B">閎</persName>共殺<persName id="c-songshu-050-yuan-lang:p001:m0040" ref="r8r_y2a_mif">曇洛</persName>等五人，詣官歸罪，見原。<persName id="c-songshu-050-yuan-lang:p001:m0054" ref="av0_ly9_952_A">閬</persName>，大明三年，自義興太守為寧朔將軍、兗州刺史，為竟陵王<persName id="c-songshu-050-yuan-lang:p001:m0081" ref="9d4_1cb_fb9">誕</persName>所殺。追贈征虜將軍，刺史如故。</p>
</text>
